Id: mac004e
Severity: ERROR
Category: kernel
Check: check_mac

AppArmor is active, but the list of its loaded profiles could not be
read, so whether any is enforced is unknown. The list is in
/sys/kernel/security/apparmor/profiles: only root can read it, and only
where securityfs is mounted on /sys/kernel/security (systemd mounts it;
a container usually does not have it). Run Tigris as root, or check
with 'aa-status'.
